        "MoreHomealcuni lavoriEnvironBrunello AppAgrinexGISFOinCVItalianoEnglishlibriblog",
        "Christian Bazzucchi",
        "geologo | informatico",
        "SISTEMI INFORMATIVI TERRITORIALI (GIS) - OIL&GAS SOFTWARE - BONIFICHE DI SITI INQUINATI - CARATTERIZZAZIONI AMBIENTALI - ANALISI DI RISCHIO SANITARIO - CARATTERIZZAZIONE E CONSERVAZIONE DEI BENI ARCHITETTONICI - DISCARICHE INDUSTRIALI",
        "I’m a geologist and a computer scientist with over 15 years of experience in the oil&gas and ICT sector, with strong specialization in Geographic Information Systems and as a data analyst.  I gained experiences both in individual development and also as part of larger development teams, managing multiple projects and leading small teams for the determination of the critical points and phases of development progress. I have a good knowledge of the English language.  I have also attended various specialization courses on geological and environmental risk, mining divestment, GIS and remote sensing data.",
        "My technical skills:",
        "Excellent knowledge:",
        "GIS tools: ESRI ArcGIS, Quantum GIS, Geoserver, OpenLayers, GE Smalworld",
        "RDBMS : Oracle PL/SQL, PostgreSQL - PostGIS, MS Access, MS SQL Server, Spatialite",
        "Spatial data sets: Shapefiles, WMS, WFS, WFS, multispectral raster images, GeoTIFF, PostGIS Layer, Oracle Spatial, ESRI Personal Geodatabase and ArcSDE",
        "Operating systems: Windows, Debian and derivatives (such as Ubuntu)",
        "Good knowledge of the following technologies: Petrel, Techlog, Omega, Visage, AutoCAD/Map, Revit, Intergraph Geomedia, Wellview, ENVI, Interpret, Lennartz MARS, Seisan, MESA, NORSAR, WinLog, Surfer, Move, Fieldmove&Clino, SAR interferometry",
        "Good knowledge of some programming languages: Java, Phyton, PHP, VBA, HTML, CSS",
        "Familiar with Grass, Zoo, MySQL, MySQL, SQLite, Visual Studio (Reporting Services, Visual Web Developer), Rockworks, LogPlot, Origin, Strater.",
        "Other tools: CMS (Drupal, Joomla, Alfresco), VirtualBox, VMWare, Apache Tomcat, Autodesk MapGuide, Sharepoint, MS Lync, MS Lync, Skype, Jabber, Corel Draw, Photoshop, Android.",
        "With excellent communication and organizational skills, I have been involved in several projects, such as supporting a major gas company in a project to clone GIS & oil&gas softwares, or water network management, or the development of a webGIS software for precision farming. In my past experiences there are also the acquisition of instrumental data through differential GPS detection, the use of artificial intelligence systems for cultural heritage and the teaching of computer science in technical institutions.",
        "EMPOLI (FI)",
